caption: Tradition Paths
tradition-component: tradition-paths

Choose exactly one Dreadhound Path when gaining the Tradition: Ravager, Analyst, or Veiled. The choice is fixed and cannot be replaced through ordinary advancement or Mastery. Each Path grants one fixed Psi Power Talent with general access rather than a closed ability list. The Path Talent does not occupy a secondary-Talent slot and may be raised to 4 before Mastery. Before Mastery, the Path grants general Advanced access to its Power; after Dreadhound Mastery, it grants general Master access.
